  <p class="muted">Last updated: <!-- TODO: 日付 --></p>
  <h2>What this site collects</h2>
  <p>
    This site does not ask you to create an account or submit personal information.
    <!-- TODO: アクセス解析（Cloudflare Web Analytics / Google Analytics など）を入れたら、ここに名前と目的を書く -->
  </p>
  <h2>Affiliate links and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    When you click an affiliate link, the partner site may set cookies to record that you came
    from this site. Those cookies are governed by the partner's own privacy policy.
  </p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><!-- TODO: 問い合わせ先（専用のメールアドレスやフォーム） --></p>
</Base>
